OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser jailed, a #1 ferry ride and
OL,4,Atop GCSE pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student from Swindon, who lost her
OL,7,Fmum just one month before taking her
OL,8,FGCSEs, has achieved the highest results
OL,9,Fin her school, external. The family of
OL,10,FJodi Omar - who got eight grade 9s, two
OL,11,Fgrade 8s and one grade 7 at Abbey Park
OL,12,FAcademy - described her results as "a
OL,13,Ftestament to her hard work,
OL,14,Fdetermination and resilience".
