OL,3,GNEWSAAbuser jailed, a #1 ferry ride and
OL,4,Atop GCSE pupil
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man from Melksham has been jailed
OL,7,Fafter he threatened a woman in her 20s.
OL,8,FHe told her he was going to "pay
OL,9,Fsomeone to cut her head off, external",
OL,10,Freported Somerset Live. Joe Martin, 28,
OL,11,Fpleaded guilty to controlling and
OL,12,Fcoercive behaviour after he grabbed the
OL,13,Fwoman from a Bath pub and locked her in
OL,14,Fhis car.
